        "role": "user",
        "content": "<report>\nBAYLINE BUILDERS - SUPERINTENDENT DAILY REPORT\nForm DR-1 rev 3\n================================================================\nProject: Harbor Point Medical Office Building\nJob No.: 2417\nReport Date: 2026-09-08\nSuperintendent: Dana Okafor\nReport No.: 6\nWEATHER\nConditions: Partly cloudy\nHigh / Low (F): 86 / 74\nWeather Delay (hrs): 0\nMANPOWER\nCompany | Trade | Headcount | Hours\n----------------------------------------------------------------\nBayline Builders (self-perform) | laborers | 3 | 8\nKeystone Interiors LLC | drywall | 8 | 8\nVolt Line Electric, Inc. | electrical | 5 | 8\nTidewater Mechanical | hvac | 6 | 8\nClearwater Plumbing Co. | plumbing | 5 | 8\nRedline Fire Protection | fire_sprinkler | 4 | 8\nSummit Roofing & Sheet Metal | roofing | 5 | 8\nGlassline Curtainwall | curtain_wall | 4 | 8\nGravel & Grade Sitework | sitework | 4 | 8\nTOTAL | | 44 |\nWORK COMPLETED\n- [L2 west] (plumbing) Roughed in restroom core waste and vent\n- [East parking lot] (sitework) Graded east parking area\n- [L2 west] (fire_sprinkler) Ran branch lines\n- [South elevation] (curtain_wall) Set curtain wall anchors\n- [L3 east] (laborers) Cleaned L1 and L2, loaded dumpster\nDELAYS\n- None\nSAFETY\n- None\nINSPECTIONS\n- In-wall rough-in L1 | City of Harbor Point Building Dept | pass | OK to close L1 walls\nDELIVERIES\n- Northwind HVAC Equipment | RTU-1 and RTU-2 rooftop units | Set by crane 6:30-9:30 AM\nVISITORS\n- None\nNOTES\nRTU pick went well; crane off site by 10.\n</report>\n\nExtract this report with record_daily_report."
